5399</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R23"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mador</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Magalang</surname><given-names>UJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kufel</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Twitch potentiation following voluntary diaphragmatic contraction</article-title><source>Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>1994</year><volume>3 Pt 1</volume><fpage>739</fpage><lpage>743</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8118645</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R24"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal"><collab>ATS/ACCP</collab><article-title>ATS/ACCP Statement on cardiopulmonary exercise testing</article-title><source> Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>211</fpage><lpage>277</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="R25"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Babcock</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Pegelow</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name><name><surname>Harms</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dempsey</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of respiratory muscle unloading on exercise-induced diaphragm fatigue</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>201</fpage><lpage>206</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12070206</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R26"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Verges</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Notter</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Spengler</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence of diaphragm and rib cage muscle fatigue on breathing durin